  ('a-gentler-commute', 282, 'Bring earplugs or soft headphones for a noisy train ride and enjoy a little quiet.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 283, 'Visualize leaving your work stress at the office door as you step out tonight.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 284, 'On the bus home, think about three people who made your day a little better.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 285, 'If you walk, choose a street with more trees or shop windows today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 286, 'When your phone buzzes while driving, let it wait until you are parked.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 287, 'Spend a few minutes tonight planning tomorrow''s departure time and stick to it.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 288, 'In winter darkness, notice the glow of headlights, porch lights and storefronts on your way.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 289, 'Hold the elevator for someone coming from the parking garage.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 290, 'Reflect on the most peaceful commute you have ever had, and what made it so.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 291, 'Carpool kids today? Let each child share one high and one low from their day on the ride home.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 292, 'Turn off notifications during your ride so your trip can be your own time.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 293, 'Keep your car keys, wallet and cell phone in the same bag pocket every day so you never hunt for them.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 294, 'Notice the first person you see smiling on your way today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 295, 'Stand near a window on the train and watch the light change as you move.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 296, 'When you board, choose to be the calmest person in your car today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 297, 'Drive with both hands relaxed on the wheel, holding it firmly enough but no tighter.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 298, 'At a bus or train stop, notice the textures of the bench, the pole and the pavement beneath you.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 299, 'On the drive home, let your thoughts wander to a happy memory.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 300, 'Bring water for a hot day and sip it before you set out.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 301, 'When you leave work, take a moment to notice whether you feel tired, hungry or restless, and plan for it.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 302, 'If your usual route is closed, see the detour as a chance to see something new.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 303, 'Before school drop off, take three deep breaths together with your kids.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 304, 'On a busy sidewalk, slow your pace a little and let the rushing crowd flow around you.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 305, 'Try counting the number of red lights you hit and greet each one with a relaxed breath.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 306, 'Spend one ride today listening to sounds of nature, birdsong or rain, instead of the radio.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 307, 'When you arrive, take a moment to appreciate that you got there safely.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 308, 'Walk part of the way home with a friend or coworker, if your routes overlap.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 309, 'When the car ahead brakes suddenly, notice your reaction, then let your shoulders drop again.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 310, 'Keeping your eyes on the road at a stop, notice the texture of the steering wheel under your hands.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 311, 'Remind yourself that traffic is not personal the next time you get stuck.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 312, 'Notice whether your breathing is fast or slow as you walk into your workplace.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 313, 'Prepare tomorrow''s breakfast tonight so you can eat calmly before leaving.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 314, 'On a crowded platform, practice patience by letting one train go if the crowd is too thick.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 315, 'Choose to bike to the store or a friend''s home on a nice day instead of driving.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 316, 'Watch the sunset or sunrise from your window seat or while waiting at a stop.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 317, 'Give the slow walker in front of you room and time instead of weaving past.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 318, 'Take the long way to your car at the end of the day and stretch your legs.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 319, 'Ask yourself what you need for the evening as you head home, rest, company or quiet.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 320, 'Spend a stop on the train noticing how your feet rest on the floor.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 321, 'When you reach your desk, write down one thing from your commute you enjoyed.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 322, 'Imagine your car or seat as a quiet room between work and home, and treat it gently.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 323, 'On a windy day, notice the trees and flags moving as you travel.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 324, 'While parked, roll your wrists in slow circles to release the hold of the steering wheel.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 325, 'Pick a quiet radio station for the drive and keep the volume low.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 326, 'Plan a trip with fewer transfers if you can, even if it takes a little longer.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 327, 'Bring a warm hat on a winter walk to the station so the cold feels gentler.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 328, 'Take an extra lap around the parking lot on foot after you park, just to breathe.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 329, 'On your way out the door, say something kind to whoever is home.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 330, 'Choose an easy breakfast you can eat at home rather than in traffic.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 331, 'At the next stoplight, let go of any thought about how late you might be.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 332, 'When passing through a tunnel or under a bridge, use it as a cue to relax your face.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 333, 'Welcome a new rider or carpool member with a friendly hello.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 334, 'If your bike route has a hill, take it slowly and enjoy the view from the top.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 335, 'Look for one kindness between strangers on public transit today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 336, 'When the bus lurches, hold on and let your body find its balance without tensing.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 337, 'Find a moment today to appreciate the people who keep your roads and rails running.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 338, 'Let your car warm up or cool down while you take a slow breath and plan your route.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 339, 'After a long commute, take a warm shower or wash your face to mark the end of the trip.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 340, 'When you sit at a long light, listen to the hum of your engine or the rain on the roof.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 341, 'Spend a few minutes tonight packing the car for tomorrow''s school run.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 342, 'Notice when you are about to rush, and choose to walk at a normal pace instead.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 343, 'Working remotely? Pick a set route around your block and walk it at the same time each morning, like a real commute.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 344, 'Notice the fresh smell of a morning after rain as you leave the house.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 345, 'Ask a regular on your bus or train how their week is going.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 346, 'Before you start driving, put your cell phone out of reach so the road has your attention.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 347, 'When the subway is delayed, use the time to stretch your back gently.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 348, 'Let the sight of a familiar landmark remind you that you are almost home.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 349, 'Hold a calm silence in the car for one minute after school pick up, then ask about the day.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 350, 'On a bright fall day, notice the colors of the leaves along the road.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 351, 'Make a small change to your morning routine that buys you two extra minutes to leave calmly.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 352, 'Let a pedestrian cross in front of you with a smile and a wave.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 353, 'Take a slow, full breath as you step onto the train and feel the doors close behind you.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 354, 'When you notice road rage rising, turn the music softer and let the moment pass.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 355, 'Keep a list of calming songs in your car and add one new song today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 356, 'Pause to enjoy the first quiet moment of your day after the commute ends.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 357, 'In a long line of cars, picture the people inside each one going to their own day.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 358, 'Bring a light jacket on a spring morning so the cool air feels pleasant rather than harsh.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 359, 'Walk around your car once before you get in, noticing the morning around you.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 360, 'Talk with your carpool about something fun you are planning this weekend.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 361, 'Once you are outside after work, find the sky and give it a long look before you get in your car or onto the train.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 362, 'Learn the name of one street, park or creek you cross every day but have never noticed.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 363, 'Notice your favorite part of your daily commute and enjoy it fully today.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 364, 'Thank yourself for getting through today''s trip, whatever it was like.'),
  ('a-gentler-commute', 365, 'Choose, from everything you have tried in this challenge, the one habit you most want to keep on every commute.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
